 patch before the installation ... ?).  Then it started printing
 out messages like the following:

	Working ... Tues May 5 11:30:02 CDT 1998
       ...
       ...
       Working ... Wed May 6 06:30:11 CDT 1998

These messages are repeated regularly at two minute
 intervals.  We had plenty of free disk space on the
 affected filesystems (e.g., /var ) before we started the
 installation.

